          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"pricing.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Pricing — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Practical, whole-person programs and session options. Transparent fees and what to expect.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#fffbf2;--bg2:#eaf6ff;--accent:#6b4cff;--muted:#6d6d72;--card:#ffffff}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:#111}\\n    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}\\n    header{position:sticky;top:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);z-index:40;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px}\\n    .logo{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:0.4px}\\n    nav a{margin:0 10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#8c6bff);color:white;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:stretch;min-height:360px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\\n    .hero .left{padding:48px 56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));clip-path:polygon(0 0,85% 0,100% 100%,0% 100%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:28px;color:#0f1724}\\n    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:48ch}\\n    .hero .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n\\n    .hero .right{position:relative;padding:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(20,16,50,0.06);width:92%;max-width:360px}\\n    .price-tag{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .price{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    section{margin-bottom:44px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}\\n    .plan{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,1),#fff);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(14,14,20,0.04)}\\n    .plan h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .plan ul{margin:10px 0 16px;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .plan .btn{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#8c6bff);color:white;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    .notes{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .testimonials{display:flex;gap:14px}\\n    .quote{background:#fbfbff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(100,80,255,0.06)}\\n\\n    footer{padding:28px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* background SVG pattern */\\n    .pattern-wrap{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.12}\\n    .pattern{width:100%;height:100%}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:840px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.hero .left{clip-path:none;padding:32px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{padding:12px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"left\\\">\\n      <h1>Tailored packages that meet you where you are</h1>\\n      <p>Holistic sessions and multi-week pathways designed for sustainable change — education, lifestyle tools, and close coaching. Transparent fees to help you choose the right starting-point.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"actions\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a discovery</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#plans\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">See full offerings</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"right\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price-tag\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Discovery Session</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$150</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">45–60 min</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">A focused first visit to review history, priorities, and an initial plan. No promises—just clear next steps and education.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 400\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fef3c7\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#eef2ff\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n        <g fill=\\\"#6b4cff\\\">\\n          <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"36\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"240\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"560\\\" cy=\\\"160\\\" r=\\\"48\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"720\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"30\\\" opacity=\\\"0.09\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section id=\\\"plans\\\">\\n      <h2>Programs & session bundles</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Select from single visits to guided multi-week pathways. Each plan emphasizes education, lifestyle tools, and measurable check-ins.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"plan\\\">\\n          <h3>Discovery - Single Visit</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$150 • 45–60 min</div>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Comprehensive intake & prioritized goals</li>\\n            <li>Personalized education and first-step plan</li>\\n            <li>Referral options and recommended resources</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book now</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"plan\\\">\\n          <h3>Reset — 8-week intensive</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$1,200 • includes 6 sessions</div>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Initial intake + 5 focused follow-ups</li>\\n            <li>Dietary, sleep, stress tools and habit coaching</li>\\n            <li>Progress tracking and email support</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Start reset</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"plan\\\">\\n          <h3>Transform — 12-week plan</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$2,700 • premium support</div>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Deep-dive intake, optional educational labs</li>\\n            <li>Weekly coaching, adaptive plans, family guidance</li>\\n            <li>Longer-term maintenance strategy</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Apply</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"notes\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Payment plans available on request. Optional lab testing is educational and may incur additional fees. No guarantees are made — outcomes vary by individual.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>A la carte sessions & add-ons</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\\\">\\n          <strong>60-min follow-up</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$130</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\\\">\\n          <strong>Nutrition review</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$90</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\\\">\\n          <strong>Detailed lab consultation</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$180</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>What others say</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonials\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\n          \\\"{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} helped me understand how small adjustments add up. The plan felt realistic and supportive.\\\"\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— S.L., {{CITY}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\n          \\\"Clear teaching and practical tools. I appreciated the step-by-step follow-ups and check-ins.\\\"\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— M.R., remote client</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"notes\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Testimonials reflect individual experiences and do not guarantee similar results for others.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>Ready to pick a path?</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Start with a Discovery visit if you prefer to explore options without commitment. For deeper support, choose a guided plan.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Who we are: integrative, practical care rooted in education and collaboration.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bgA:#fff7f2;--accent:#2b9be3;--muted:#5b6270}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#0b1220}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.95),#fff);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .hero{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:48px 20px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .diagonal{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bgA),#eef9ff);padding:28px;border-radius:18px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,95% 0,70% 100%,0% 100%)}\\n    .diagonal h1{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .diagonal p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}\\n    .bio{flex:1;padding:18px}\\n    .bio .avatar{width:100%;max-width:220px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7f9ff);padding:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(10,10,30,0.06)}\\n    main{max-width:1000px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    .story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:22px}\\n    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .framework{margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdff);padding:12px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef8ff;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin-right:8px}\\n    .test{margin-top:12px}\\n    footer{padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n\\n    .pattern-embed{position:absolute;right:-10%;top:-8%;width:480px;height:480px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:820px){.story{grid-template-columns:1fr}.diagonal{clip-path:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Start</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Team</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"diagonal\\\">\\n      <h1>We help you learn how your body makes sense</h1>\\n      <p>Integrative care that blends evidence-informed therapies with personalized lifestyle support. We prioritize understanding, not quick fixes.</p>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"bio\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n        <strong>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">{{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">I focus on educating clients about how nutrition, sleep, movement and stress interact so they can make informed choices that fit their life.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern-embed\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"pA\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fff7ed\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e8f7ff\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#pA)\\\" rx=\\\"20\\\"/>\\n      <g fill=\\\"#2b9be3\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M30 60c10-20 40-30 60-20s40 40 20 60-60 10-80-10\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"160\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"story\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Our story</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Founded on a belief that long-term wellness is learned and practiced. We build partnerships with each person — translating data into clear practices. We avoid one-size-fits-all promises; instead we aim for steady, teachable progress.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"framework\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h3>How we structure care</h3>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Intake</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Plan</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Follow-up</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Education</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Each stage includes actionable teaching and measurable check-ins. Optional labs are discussed as educational tools rather than absolute answers.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Values</h4>\\n          <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Curiosity over certainty</li>\\n            <li>Small, sustainable changes</li>\\n            <li>Clear communication and consent</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h4>Quick facts</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Telehealth and in-person options. Educational labs available on request. Insurance receipts provided on request.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3>Clients say</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"test\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          \\\"I finally understood why my sleep mattered for my digestion. The steps were practical and felt realistic.\\\"\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— A.K.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3>Work with us</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">To begin, book a Discovery session. We'll review your history, priorities, and possible next steps — with clear education and options.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;background:#2b9be3;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a discovery</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Book a discovery or multi-week program. Learn what to expect at your first visit.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--accent:#7c3aed;--muted:#666}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:#0b1020;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdff)}\\n    header{padding:12px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);position:sticky;top:0}\\n    .nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}\\n    .nav a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:12px}\\n\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px}\\n    .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:18px}\\n    .panel{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    input,select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08)}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#a78bfa);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .what-to-bring{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;right:6px;top:120px;width:260px;height:260px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pattern{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Return</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Issues</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How it works</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#a78bfa);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px\\\" href=\\\"#book-form\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"split\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h1>Reserve your Discovery</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A Discovery session is a practical first visit — history, priorities, and an educational plan. No cures promised; just clear options and next steps.</p>\\n\\n          <form id=\\\"book-form\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n            <label>Full name<input name=\\\"name\\\" required></label>\\n            <label>Email<input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\"></label>\\n            <label>Phone<input name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\"></label>\\n            <label>Service<select name=\\\"service\\\">\\n              <option>Discovery - 45–60min</option>\\n              <option>60-min follow-up</option>\\n              <option>Reset program inquiry</option>\\n            </select></label>\\n            <label>Brief concerns/notes<textarea name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"What brings you here?\\\"></textarea></label>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request appointment</button>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"note\\\">By submitting you agree to be contacted by {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Any testing discussed is optional and may have separate costs. We do not promise specific outcomes.</div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h3>How booking works</h3>\\n          <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Complete the request form.</li>\\n            <li>We confirm availability and next steps by email.</li>\\n            <li>First session focuses on education and a clear plan.</li>\\n          </ol>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">If you prefer a virtual visit, note it in the form. For in-person appointments, directions and parking info will be provided.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h3>Before your first visit</h3>\\n          <ul class=\\\"what-to-bring\\\">\\n            <li>Recent labs or records (if available)</li>\\n            <li>A list of medications and supplements</li>\\n            <li>Photos of commonly eaten meals (optional)</li>\\n            <li>Questions you want answered</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">If labs are suggested, they are for education and the decision is yours. Insurance varies; receipts provided for out-of-network reimbursement on request.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h4>Need help choosing?</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">If unsure, choose Discovery. It’s a focused session to learn your options and map a realistic plan.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;margin-top:10px\\\">View fees</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"bG\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fff2fb\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#eef6ff\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#bG)\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n      <g fill=\\\"#7c3aed\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M20 60c16-24 56-36 96-24s64 48 36 84-104 20-132-12\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <h3>Common questions</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>What if I need labs?</strong> Labs may be offered as educational tools. They are optional and billed separately. <br><strong>Do you guarantee outcomes?</strong> No. We provide education and personalized plans; outcomes vary by individual.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer style=\\\"padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
